<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>My Coding</title><link>https://mengxingdemeng.github.io/hugo-blog/</link><description>My Coding</description><generator>Hugo 0.165.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 05 Jul 2026 11:48:13 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://mengxingdemeng.github.io/hugo-blog/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>进阶指南day1</title><link>https://mengxingdemeng.github.io/hugo-blog/posts/db0cd0f/</link><pubDate>Sun, 05 Jul 2026 11:48:13 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://mengxingdemeng.github.io/hugo-blog/posts/db0cd0f/</guid><category domain="https://mengxingdemeng.github.io/hugo-blog/categories/draft/">Draft</category><description>&lt;p&gt;这个夏天，让我开始研习李煜东大神的算法竞赛进阶指南&#10;&lt;a href="https://imgchr.com/i/pm0bCwV" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" src='https://s41.ax1x.com/2026/07/05/pm0bCwV.png' alt="pm0bCwV.png"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="洛谷和vjudge以及ac-wing都有题单哦"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.luogu.com.cn/training/400" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;洛谷&lt;/a&gt;和&lt;a href="https://vjudge.net/article/3573" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;vjudge&lt;/a&gt;以及&lt;a href="https://www.acwing.com/problem/search/1/?csrfmiddlewaretoken=MKUiDRtg5tVmqfHubk65Mz95UnNlnAyHFAupGr1wFiRjjVATcV4SJMiCGDQlYdZw&amp;amp;show_algorithm_tags=0&amp;amp;search_content=%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95%E7%AB%9E%E8%B5%9B%E8%BF%9B%E9%98%B6%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;AC Wing&lt;/a&gt;都有题单哦&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e6%b4%9b%e8%b0%b7%e5%92%8cvjudge%e4%bb%a5%e5%8f%8aac-wing%e9%83%bd%e6%9c%89%e9%a2%98%e5%8d%95%e5%93%a6" class="heading-mark"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;$2026.7.5$&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 class="heading-element" id="0x00-基本算法"&gt;&lt;span&gt;0x00 基本算法&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#0x00-%e5%9f%ba%e6%9c%ac%e7%ae%97%e6%b3%95" class="heading-mark"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="memset-函数"&gt;&lt;span&gt;memset 函数&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#memset-%e5%87%bd%e6%95%b0" class="heading-mark"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="1-头文件与原型"&gt;&lt;span&gt;1. 头文件与原型&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#1-%e5%a4%b4%e6%96%87%e4%bb%b6%e4%b8%8e%e5%8e%9f%e5%9e%8b" class="heading-mark"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;#include &amp;lt;string.h&amp;gt;&#10;void *memset(void *ptr, int value, size_t num);&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h4 class="heading-element" id="参数说明"&gt;&lt;span&gt;参数说明：&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e5%8f%82%e6%95%b0%e8%af%b4%e6%98%8e" class="heading-mark"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;ptr&lt;/code&gt;：要填充的内存起始地址（任意类型指针，void* 兼容 char/int/ 结构体 / 数组）&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;value&lt;/code&gt;：填充的字节值，&lt;strong&gt;仅低 8 位有效&lt;/strong&gt;（0~255），int 只是参数类型，实际按 unsigned char 写入内存&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;num&lt;/code&gt;：填充&lt;strong&gt;字节个数&lt;/strong&gt;，不是元素个数！核心易错点&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;返回值：传入的 ptr 指针本身&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="2-底层原理"&gt;&lt;span&gt;2. 底层原理&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#2-%e5%ba%95%e5%b1%82%e5%8e%9f%e7%90%86" class="heading-mark"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;memset 直接操作&lt;strong&gt;原始内存字节&lt;/strong&gt;，逐一字节赋值，不区分变量类型、不识别数组元素，只看字节长度。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="3标准示例"&gt;&lt;span&gt;3.标准示例&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#3%e6%a0%87%e5%87%86%e7%a4%ba%e4%be%8b" class="heading-mark"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4 class="heading-element" id="示例-1字符数组清零--填充字符"&gt;&lt;span&gt;示例 1：字符数组清零 / 填充字符&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e7%a4%ba%e4%be%8b-1%e5%ad%97%e7%ac%a6%e6%95%b0%e7%bb%84%e6%b8%85%e9%9b%b6--%e5%a1%ab%e5%85%85%e5%ad%97%e7%ac%a6" class="heading-mark"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;char buf[100];&#10;// 全部置 &amp;#39;\0&amp;#39;（清零）&#10;memset(buf, 0, sizeof(buf));&#10;// 全部填充 &amp;#39;#&amp;#39;&#10;memset(buf, &amp;#39;#&amp;#39;, sizeof(buf));&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h4 class="heading-element" id="示例-2int-数组清零唯一安全的多类型填充"&gt;&lt;span&gt;示例 2：int 数组清零（唯一安全的多类型填充）&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e7%a4%ba%e4%be%8b-2int-%e6%95%b0%e7%bb%84%e6%b8%85%e9%9b%b6%e5%94%af%e4%b8%80%e5%ae%89%e5%85%a8%e7%9a%84%e5%a4%9a%e7%b1%bb%e5%9e%8b%e5%a1%ab%e5%85%85" class="heading-mark"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;int arr[10];&#10;memset(arr, 0, sizeof(arr));&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;内存中每个字节写 0，4 字节 int 整体就是 &lt;code&gt;0x00000000&lt;/code&gt;，数值为 0。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h4 class="heading-element" id="示例-3结构体清零常用初始化"&gt;&lt;span&gt;示例 3：结构体清零（常用初始化）&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e7%a4%ba%e4%be%8b-3%e7%bb%93%e6%9e%84%e4%bd%93%e6%b8%85%e9%9b%b6%e5%b8%b8%e7%94%a8%e5%88%9d%e5%a7%8b%e5%8c%96" class="heading-mark"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;struct Student {&#10; char name[20];&#10; int age;&#10; float score;&#10;} stu;&#10;// 结构体整块内存清零&#10;memset(&amp;amp;stu, 0, sizeof(stu));&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h4 class="heading-element" id="示例-4动态分配内存初始化"&gt;&lt;span&gt;示例 4：动态分配内存初始化&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e7%a4%ba%e4%be%8b-4%e5%8a%a8%e6%80%81%e5%88%86%e9%85%8d%e5%86%85%e5%ad%98%e5%88%9d%e5%a7%8b%e5%8c%96" class="heading-mark"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;int *p = malloc(10 * sizeof(int));&#10;if(p != NULL) {&#10; memset(p, 0, 10 * sizeof(int));&#10;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="快速幂"&gt;&lt;span&gt;快速幂&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e5%bf%ab%e9%80%9f%e5%b9%82" class="heading-mark"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 